 "title": "Owen County Addressing Services | Auditor’s Office",
 "text": "Owen County Addressing Services | Auditor’s Office\nSkip to content ⚠ Owen County Travel Status: Yellow – Advisory. Use caution; routine travel may be restricted in hazardous areas. | 211 is now active for Owen County residents to report storm damage.\n✕\nOwen County Government\nOfficial Website of Owen County, Indiana\nSearch\nMain Menu Main Menu\nHome\nAbout Owen County\nLegal & Policies\nADA Statement\nPrivacy Policy\nPublic Records Request\nTitle VI Statement\nLocal Attractions\nNews & Updates\nGovernment\nCounty Directory\nElection Board & Voter Registration\nOrdinances & Resolutions\nRedevelopment Commission\nDepartments\nAuditor\nAddressing\nAssessor\nBuilding & Planning\nCASA\nCircuit Court I\nCircuit Court II\nClerk\nCommissioners\nCoroner\nCouncil\nCourt Services\nGIS & Mapping\nHealth Department\nHighway Department\nMaintenance\nProsecutor\nRecorder\nSurveyor\nTreasurer\nVeteran Services\nPublic Safety & Emergency Services\n911 Communications Center\nEMS\nOCEMS Employment Application\nOCEMS History\nEMS FAQs\nIn Memory\nNotice of Privacy Practices\nSafe Sleep Program\nRescue\nEMA\nSecurity Center\nSheriff’s Office\nPublic Services\nEmployment Opportunities\nPermits & Licensing\nProperty Taxes\nSoil & Water\nCalendar & Events\nContact\nHome » Departments » Auditor » Addressing\nAddressing\nThe Owen County Addressing system is managed by the GIS team within the Mapping Division of the Auditor’s Office. This service ensures every property and structure has a unique and accurate address, which is essential for emergency response, delivery services, and utility setup.\nIf you need to request a new address for an undeveloped property or structure, or require a secondary address for special use, please contact our GIS Department directly using the information below.\nAddressing Services\nAssigning new addresses for previously unaddressed properties or buildings\nIssuing secondary addresses for additional structures or special use cases\nVerifying existing addresses\nAssisting with address correction or clarification\nProviding address and parcel data for GIS analysis or reference\nContact Information\nJason Parker\nGIS Coordinator\nOwen County Auditor’s Office – Mapping Department\n60 S Main Street\nSpencer, IN 47460\n(812) 829-5000 ext. 167\nJason.Parker@owencounty.in.gov\nOwen County GIS\nFor any inquiries related to address assignment or verification in Owen County, please reach out using the contact details above. Our GIS department is happy to assist residents, property owners, developers, and emergency services in maintaining accurate address records countywide.\nPage Last Updated\nSeptember 21, 2025\nContact Us\nOwen County Courthouse\n60 S. Main Street\nSpencer, IN 47460\nAuditor’s Office\n(812) 829-5000\nHours of Operation\nMonday – Friday: 8:00 AM to 4:00 PM\nClosed 12:00 PM – 1:00 PM for lunch\nClosed on weekends & federal holidays\nConnect With Us\nFacebook\nYouTube\nQuick Links\nDepartments\nCourt Services\nGovernment\nCalendar & Events\nPublic Records Request\nEmployment\nOwen County is a proud member of the Association of Indiana Counties and the National Association of Counties, working collaboratively to strengthen local governance and community services at both the state and national levels.\n© 2026 Owen County, Indiana. All rights reserved.\nPrivacy Policy | Accessibility Statement | Legal Center | Login\nWebsite Design & Site Management by David Martin Design LLC .",
